msgstr "Check memory…"

#: wiibackup_manager/widgets/memory_check_view.py:144
msgid ""
"No hay ninguna memoria conectada. Conectá un pendrive o una tarjeta SD y "
"tocá el botón de actualizar."
msgstr ""
"No memory is connected. Plug in a USB stick or an SD card and press the "
"refresh button."

#: wiibackup_manager/widgets/memory_check_view.py:173
#: wiibackup_manager/widgets/memory_check_view.py:194
msgid "Formatear en FAT32"
msgstr "Format as FAT32"

#: wiibackup_manager/widgets/memory_check_view.py:175
msgid ""
"Formateo de propósito general: deja la memoria vacía y en FAT32, que lo lee "
"cualquier cosa (Windows, teléfonos, cámaras, consolas). No arma las carpetas "
"de Wii -para eso está Modo Fábrica. Borra TODO el contenido actual."
msgstr ""
"General-purpose formatting: leaves the memory empty and in FAT32, which "
"anything can read (Windows, phones, cameras, consoles). It does not create "
"the Wii folders -that is what Factory Mode is for. It erases ALL the current "
"contents."

